# Recommended Portfolio Sections

# 1. Hero Section

## Goal

Immediate visual impact.

## Include

* strong headline
* short intro
* animated background
* CTA buttons
* profile image or avatar
* floating UI elements
* social links

---

## Example Headline

Designing modern digital experiences with motion, clarity, and product thinking.

---

## Hero Animations

* mouse glow effect
* text reveal animation
* floating gradients
* smooth fade-in
* animated grid
* cursor interaction

---

# 2. Featured Projects

## Most Important Section

Use large project cards.

---

## Featured Projects

### 1. WMS Mobile App

Inventory + dispatch + workflow management app.

### 2. Dog Daycare Booking Platform

Booking system + admin dashboard.

### 3. WooCommerce Client Projects

Responsive websites and online stores.

### 4. Branding Projects

Identity design and marketing creatives.

---

## Each Project Should Include

* project overview
* role
* tools used
* problem
* solution
* final design
* mobile mockups
* UI screens
* design process
* outcome

---

## Project Card Effects

* hover zoom
* glow border
* tilt interaction
* smooth transitions
* animated CTA arrow

---

# 3. About Section

## Keep It Short

Talk about:

* your experience
* startup environment
* UI/UX thinking
* future game UI direction

Avoid long paragraphs.

---

# 4. Skills Section

## Better Than Progress Bars

Use:

* animated skill chips
* floating tags
* categorized layout

---

## Categories

### UI/UX

Figma
Wireframing
Prototyping
User Flow
Design Systems

### Frontend

HTML
CSS
JavaScript
WordPress
WooCommerce

### Branding

Logo Design
Typography
Identity Design
Marketing Creatives

---

# 5. Experience Timeline

## Use Animated Vertical Timeline

### Timeline Content

2024 → Present
RedMind Technologies
UI/UX & WordPress Designer

Add:

* scroll reveal
* glowing timeline dots
* animated connectors

---

# 6. Testimonials / Metrics

## Example Metrics

8–12 Websites Delivered
1+ Years Experience
Multiple Live Client Projects
International Client Experience

---

# 7. Contact Section

## Design Style

Glassmorphism card.

Include:

* email
* LinkedIn
* Behance
* Dribbble
* CTA button

