# Best Animation Libraries

## 1. GSAP

For premium animations.

[https://gsap.com](https://gsap.com)

---

## 2. Lenis

For smooth scrolling.

[https://lenis.darkroom.engineering](https://lenis.darkroom.engineering)

---

## 3. Swiper.js

For sliders and carousels.

[https://swiperjs.com](https://swiperjs.com)

---

## 4. SplitType

For text animations.

[https://www.npmjs.com/package/split-type](https://www.npmjs.com/package/split-type)

