# Responsive Design Strategy

## Desktop

Main cinematic experience.

## Tablet

Simplified spacing.

## Mobile

Fast and minimal.

---

# Spacing System

Use 8px system.

Examples:
8
16
24
32
48
64
96
128

---

# Important UX Rules

## Avoid

* too many colors
* excessive blur
* slow animations
* crowded sections
* giant text blocks
* inconsistent spacing
* too many font styles

---

# Your Portfolio Goal

The website should feel like:

* modern startup product designer
* premium digital product creator
* motion-focused UI designer
* future-ready interface designer

NOT like:

* beginner portfolio
* template clone
* basic freelancer site

